    "aliases": ["RealToxicityPrompts", "Real Toxicity Prompts", "RealToxicity"],
    "description": "Tests how often language models produce toxic text from naturally occurring English web prompts. The set has about 100K sentence halves from OpenWebText with Perspective API toxicity scores. Models continue each prompt; Perspective scores the continuations. Headline metrics are expected maximum toxicity over 25 samples and the probability of at least one toxic continuation (toxicity ≥ 0.5).",
    "summary": "Measures how often the model writes toxic text when it continues natural web text prompts.",
